   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really good, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Going hiking in the hills next week. There's zero signal up there.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Download offline maps before you go. Most map apps let you save an area to your phone.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.19,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How big an area?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.03,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Draw the box a bit wider than your route, in case you take a wrong turn. It takes a few minutes on wifi.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And battery? Using maps all day",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "kills my phone.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.76,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Turn on airplane mode, GPS still works without signal. And bring a small power bank, just in case.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Airplane mode and GPS works? I didn't know that.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.48,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yep, GPS comes from satellites, not your network. Your blue dot will still move.",
